<title>EGYPT: Egypt's EAB Q1 net is 22.9 mln pounds.</title>
<headline>Egypt's EAB Q1 net is 22.9 mln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures are in millions of Egyptian pounds. The comparative figures refer to the whole of 1996):</p>
<p>				  Jan97-March97    Jan96-Dec96</p>
<p> Interest received		50.3		202.8</p>
<p> Interest paid		    51.6		216.7</p>
<p> Revenue from services etc.   22.8		 66.9</p>
<p> Investment revenue	     20.9		113.3</p>
<p> Expenses			   16.4		 64.5</p>
<p> Provisions			  3.1		 11.2</p>
<p> Net profits			22.9		 90.6</p>
<p>Extracts from balance sheet (all figures in millions of Egyptian pounds):</p>
<p>				   31MARCH97	   31DEC96</p>
<p> Total assets		   3,976.9	    4,076.5</p>
<p> Total customer deposits    3,029.2	    3,145.0</p>
<p> Provisions			  15.9		 15.4</p>
<p> Shareholders funds	     361.2		348.5</p>
<p>Note- Full name is Egyptian American Bank. The requirement for quarterly results was only introduced during the last 12 months and the bank gave no indication whether the reported quarter was better or worse than a year earlier.</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
